<h3><u>Maula Madine Wale</u></h3>
                <div style="width:100%">
                                <p><p>Jin Ka Nana NABI (SAWW)<br />
Jin Ka Baba ALI (AS)<br />
Jin Ki Maa FATEMA (SA)<br />
Jin Ka Bhai HASAN (AS)</p>

<p>Woh Hai Maula Hamare HUSAIN (AS).....2</p>

<p>Maula Madine Wale.....4</p>

<p>Karbal Mein Aa Gaie Hai, Karbal Basane Wale<br />
